  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PAR-Let the Women Explain, Equla Access, Equal opportunity, Equal Voice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of the proposed project (Phase III) is to further contribute to the empowerment of women and gender equality in Turkey. The project aims to ensure that more female experts are visible in media through appearances on political TV-shows, on social media, or in business-related issues. The organization has previously established a network which serves as the main mechanism to achieve this goal.</narrative>
  </description>
